            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-xl",
            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<p>There’s something magical about waking up and feeling genuinely rested — not groggy, not sluggish, but truly refreshed. Yet for many of us, those mornings feel rare. The truth is, restful sleep isn’t just about how long we’re in bed; it’s about the environment that surrounds us while we’re there. The air we breathe, the sounds we hear, even the light that wakes us — they all quietly shape how deeply we sleep. </p><p>At Blueair, the connection between air and well-being runs deep. With products like the DreamWell™ Humidifier and Mini Restful™ Sunrise Clock Air Purifier, creating a sleep sanctuary is no longer about chasing silence and darkness alone — it’s about <em>harmonizing</em> the air, light, and rhythm of your room to align with the body’s natural need for rest. </p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "s3"
          }
        },
        "image_caption_Xi6zz4": {
