            "margin_top_desktop": "desktop:mt-xl",
            "margin_bottom_desktop": "desktop:mb-lg",
            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-lg",
            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<h4><strong>Breathing Easy: The Foundation of Restorative Sleep</strong> </h4><p></p><p>Imagine drifting to sleep in a room where every breath feels soft and clean — no dryness in your throat, no stuffiness in your nose. That’s what balanced humidity and clean air can do. When the air is too dry, it can leave your skin itchy and your sinuses irritated. Too damp, and you can wake up feeling clammy and restless. </p><p>The Blueair DreamWell™ Humidifier was designed for that delicate middle ground — the “sweet spot” between 30–50% humidity. Its InvisibleMist™ technology quietly infuses the room with moisture you can feel but never see, keeping the air balanced without the visible vapor or white dust that typical humidifiers create. Its sensors automatically adjust humidity levels, working up to 48 hours at a time so you can focus on sleep instead of refilling tanks. </p><p>For those who love a touch of spa-like calm, the DreamWell includes a subtle aroma stone that lets you add a few drops of essential oil- lavender, chamomile, eucalyptus, or any scent you love. The device releases a soft, delicate breeze that fills your room with your chosen aroma, creating a nightly ritual that signals it’s time to unwind. </p><p> </p><h4><strong>The Air You Breathe While You Sleep</strong> </h4><p></p><p>Clean air isn’t just for allergy season. Even when you can’t see it, microscopic particles — dust, pollen, and household pollutants — can trigger subtle disturbances that affect your breathing and the quality of your rest. That’s where the Blueair Mini Restful™ Sunrise Clock Air Purifier steps in. </p><p>Compact yet powerful, it combines HEPASilent™ filtration with a soothing sunrise alarm, blending two essentials for better quality sleep and mornings. Through the night, it quietly filters out 99.97% of airborne particles down to 0.1 microns — so silent it’s softer than a whisper. And in the morning, rather than jarring you awake, its gentle light gradually brightens, mimicking the rising sun. It’s a nudge to your circadian rhythm — a natural cue to wake feeling aligned, not alarmed. </p><p>The Mini Restful™ even doubles as a bedside hub, with soft ambient lighting and a USB-C charging port for convenience. It’s designed not only to purify but to simplify — to help your nights flow seamlessly into calm, steady mornings. </p><p> </p><h4><strong>Crafting the Perfect Atmosphere</strong> </h4><p></p><p>Every element of your room tells your body something. Light too bright, air too stale, noise too sharp — and suddenly, your mind won’t settle. A restorative bedroom, by contrast, whispers calm. </p><p>Dim the lights an hour before bed, lowering them to a warm, soft hue. Let your DreamWell quietly balance the air while your Mini Restful hums in the background, filtering and purifying as you read or wind down. The air should feel fresh but not cool, the light minimal but not cold, the sounds steady and low. </p><p>Even your wake-up moment becomes part of the story. The gradual glow of the Mini Restful’s sunrise mode lifts you gently from deep sleep — a light that feels more like dawn than a deadline. </p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        },
