            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-lg",
            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<h4><strong>Turning Ritual Into Routine</strong> </h4><p></p><p>Restorative sleep is never an accident; it’s something you cultivate night after night. Maybe that starts with turning on your humidifier while you brush your teeth, or setting your air purifier to night mode as you slip into bed. Over time, those simple gestures form a rhythm your body recognizes. </p><p>With tools like the Blueair DreamWell™ Humidifier and Mini Restful™ Sunrise Clock Air Purifier, that rhythm can become effortless. You’re not just chasing rest — you’re designing it. Every breath, every light cue, every quiet moment works together to help your mind and body restore naturally. </p><p> </p><h4><strong>Breathe. Rest. Repeat.</strong> </h4><p></p><p>A restorative bedroom isn’t built in a day, but every thoughtful change adds up — softer air, cleaner breathing, gentler waking. With Blueair’s Sleep Collection, your bedroom becomes more than a place to sleep. It becomes a space to reset, recharge, and return to yourself. </p><p>Breathe better. Sleep deeper. Wake brighter. </p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        }
